\newlabel{fig:lstm}{{4}{4}{Standard LSTM architecture. Input sequence of 12 monthly prices passes through 2~LSTM layers (hidden=32). The last time step's hidden state is projected to 12 output values via a linear layer}{figure.4}{}}
