\newlabel{fig:transformer}{{5}{5}{Transformer architecture (encoder-only). Prices are projected to $d_{\text {model}}=64$, augmented with positional encoding, and processed by 2~encoder layers with 8-head attention. The last time step's hidden representation is projected to 12~output values via a linear layer}{figure.5}{}}
