\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {14}{\ignorespaces Cross-model forecast comparison for all four crops (2024 test year). Each subplot overlays actual prices (black) with LSTM (green), Transformer (red), and ARIMA (blue) forecasts. Key observations: (a)~ARIMA diverges upward for cassava due to stationarity violations; (b)~all models miss the corn Jun--Jul spike; (c)~all models underestimate the green bean Sep--Oct peak; (d)~Transformer tracks soybean most closely overall. No single model dominates across all crops. RW-LSTM forecasts are shown separately in Fig.~\ref {fig:rwlstm_all}.}}{10}{figure.14}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:cross_model}{{14}{10}{Cross-model forecast comparison for all four crops (2024 test year). Each subplot overlays actual prices (black) with LSTM (green), Transformer (red), and ARIMA (blue) forecasts. Key observations: (a)~ARIMA diverges upward for cassava due to stationarity violations; (b)~all models miss the corn Jun--Jul spike; (c)~all models underestimate the green bean Sep--Oct peak; (d)~Transformer tracks soybean most closely overall. No single model dominates across all crops. RW-LSTM forecasts are shown separately in Fig.~\ref {fig:rwlstm_all}}{figure.14}{}}
