\newlabel{fig:gantt_opt}{{18}{11}{Optimized Gantt chart (brute-force optimal ordering). Corn and soybean were shifted to available gaps using Strategy~B (dashed borders), producing a non-overlapping four-crop rotation with total income of 39,212~THB/rai/year}{figure.18}{}}
